{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]Je[G]ru[C]sa[F]lem [C]the [G]gold[C]en,
With milk and [E7]honey [Am]blest,
[F]Be[C]neath thy [E]con[E7]tem[Am]pla[G]tion
[C]Sink [Am]heart [C]and [G]voice [Am]op[G]pressed.
[G]I [F]know [C]not, [F]O [E]I [Am]know [G]not
What [C]holy [Dm]joys [D7]are [G]there;
[G7]What [C]radi[E]ancy [E7]of [Am]glo[G]ry,
[C]What [Am]bliss [C]be[G]yond [C]compare.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C][G]They [C]stand, [F]those [C]hall [G]of [C]Zion,
[E7]All jubilant [Am]with song,
[F]And [C]bright [E]with [E7]many [Am]an [G]angel,
[C][Am]And [C]all [G]the [Am]martyr [G]throng.
[G][F]The [C]Prince [F]is [E]ever [Am]in [G]them,
[C]The [Dm]daylight [D7]is [G]serene;
[G7][C]The [E]pastures [E7]of [Am]the [G]blessed
[C]Are [Am]deck [C]in [G]glorious [C]sheen.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[C][G]There [C]is [F]the [C]throne [G]of [C]David,
[E7]And there, [Am]from care released,
[F]The [C]shout [E]of [E7]them [Am]that [G]triumph,
[C]The [Am]song [C]of [G]them [Am]that [G]feast;
[G][F]And [C]they [F]who, [E]with [Am]their [G]Leader,
[C]Have [Dm]conquered [D7]in [G]the fight,
[G7][C]Forever [E][E7]and [Am][G]forever
[C]Are [Am]clad [C]in [G]robes [C]of white.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[C][G]O [C]sweet [F][C]and [G]blessed [C]country,
[E7]The home [Am]of God's elect!
[F][C]O [E]sweet [E7]and [Am]blessed [G]country,
[C][Am]That [C]eager [G][Am]hearts [G]expect!
[G][F]Jesus, [C]in [F][E]mercy [Am]bring [G]us
[C]To [Dm]that dear [D7]land [G]of rest;
[G7]Who [C]art, [E]with [E7]God [Am]the [G]Father,
[C][Am]And [C]Spirit, [G]ever [C]blest.
{end_of_verse}
